{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWmfWVhgo3LnRwC8rxVm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011XB1cV7uVinwgUuGrWEvUW","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"interpretation":"We now have the baseline measurement for the unchanged supplied CLI (29 bytes, sha256:647697a5…) in result 6514754a. Command 0 (`node generated/hello-world.mjs`) exited 0 but printed `Hello world!\\n` without the comma. Command 1 (the component and UAT test run) exited 1: 2 tests, 0 passes, 2 failures, both on the same stdout mismatch against `Hello, world!\\n`. This is the material baseline failure the contract asks for. It also matches the adverse nonzero expectation declared for command 1 under the revision obligation. It remains historical evidence about those exact earlier bytes. The two supplied tests work as verifiers: both actually spawned the CLI and caught the defect, so they can be reused. The four authored assets are still absent, and all seven obligations remain open. The baseline justifies a different registered choice: a bounded construction correction limited to `generated/hello-world.mjs`. The failure pinpoints the exact defect, and the source requirement comes directly from the original task, so the correction does not need the design documents first. This is the steel-thread path: correct the runnable path early, then re-measure the corrected current subject. Specification and design can be written against the corrected worksite. They are not affected by the CLI bytes, except that the implementation design should describe the actual corrected source surface. Final completion still needs fresh command evidence on the corrected bytes and an independent UAT covering all mandatory outcomes.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5","contribution":"Make a bounded correction to `generated/hello-world.mjs` only, justified by the admitted baseline failure in result 6514754a. The CLI printed `Hello world!\\n` and both tests failed on the missing comma. After the change, the script must run under plain `node` with no package installation, exit 0, and write exactly `Hello, world!` followed by one newline to stdout, with nothing else on stdout. Do not modify tests, source, oracle, contract or any other path.","reason":"The contract requires the actual baseline failure to justify a different registered choice and a real correction in the same lineage. That failure is now observed: command 1 exited nonzero with 0 passes and 2 failures, and command 0 printed the wrong stdout. The defect is exactly located, and the original source stage defines the required behavior directly. The implementation design is therefore not a prerequisite for this minimal fix, so I've dropped the earlier dependency on design. Correcting now creates the direct causal link from failure to correction and establishes the steel thread early.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5","obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/8e48f0d7a3888cff05d203ffb536f1f99581cba67f3521180a072edc2bf8dc68","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c","result://abiogenesis/bc7d9d04c2fe7c8104f819f3dd260128ecc3faca42dc57446927b3ca7df16e7c"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5","contribution":"Re-measure the corrected current subject with the same fixed command plan: `node generated/hello-world.mjs` and `node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`. Record the real command, args, cwd, env, exit status, stdout, stderr and pass/fail counts for the new CLI bytes. Record any failure as observed. The baseline result stays historical evidence about the earlier bytes and is not retargeted.","reason":"The behavior obligation needs current evidence on the corrected subject: exit 0, exact stdout, at least two passes and zero failures. The baseline evidence becomes stale for current-behavior claims once construction changes the CLI bytes. The revision obligation also needs proof that the correction had a real effect.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5","contribution":"Write `specification/project-conformance.md`. It should state the Intent, Product boundary, source-grounded requirements and completion criteria for a minimal Node CLI Hello World traversal. The source surface is `generated/hello-world.mjs`. The execution proof runs the CLI and observes stdout of exactly `Hello, world!\\n` with exit 0. Completion requires the component and UAT tests to execute the real CLI, with at least two passes and zero failures, backed by truthful admitted execution evidence. No source, tests, package files or execution plans belong in this file.","reason":"The file is absent, and the conformance obligation needs fresh substantive content. It is independent of the CLI bytes and serves as the authority for the implementation design.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/8e48f0d7a3888cff05d203ffb536f1f99581cba67f3521180a072edc2bf8dc68"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5","contribution":"Write three files:\n1. `design/implementation-design.md`: uses the conformance artifact as its authority and defines the minimal Node CLI at `generated/hello-world.mjs` that prints exactly `Hello, world!` and one newline. It names the component and UAT test source surfaces, which execute the CLI and assert stdout.\n2. `design/test-design.md`: specifies component and UAT tests that spawn `node generated/hello-world.mjs` and assert status 0 and stdout of exactly `Hello, world!\\n`.\n3. `test-execution-plan.json`: command `node`; args `[\"--test\",\"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs\",\"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs\"]`; `expectedTestPassCount` of at least 2; `expectedStdoutMatch` containing stable zero-failure evidence such as `fail 0`, without pinning an exact pass-count fragment; `assertedReturnValue` of `Hello, world!`.","reason":"All three files are absent. Each has an obligation that requires fresh content consistent with the source and the conformance artifact. The plan must agree with the fixed prospective commands but does not control execution. The implementation design should describe the actual corrected source surface.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/8e48f0d7a3888cff05d203ffb536f1f99581cba67f3521180a072edc2bf8dc68"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"Independent, read-only assessment against the original source, the oracle rubric and the witness contract. It covers:\n- the content of the authored conformance, implementation design, test design and execution pla