able zero-failure evidence such as `fail 0`, without pinning an exact pass-count fragment; `assertedReturnValue` of `Hello, world!`.\",\"reason\":\"All three files are absent. Each has an obligation that requires fresh content consistent with the source and the conformance artifact. The plan must agree with the fixed prospective commands but does not control execution. The implementation design should describe the actual corrected source surface.\",\"supportRefs\":[\"obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5\"],\"evidenceRefs\":[\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\",\"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/8e48f0d7a3888cff05d203ffb536f1f99581cba67f3521180a072edc2bf8dc68\"],\"dependsOn\":[\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5\"]},{\"graphFunctionRef\":\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5\",\"contribution\":\"Independent, read-only assessment against the original source, the oracle rubric and the witness contract. It covers:\\n- the content of the authored conformance, implementation design, test design and execution plan, and how they correspond to the source and to each other;\\n- whether the supplied tests are adequate verifiers of the real CLI;\\n- whether the plan agrees with the fixed commands;\\n- the causal link from the historical baseline failure (result 6514754a) to the correction;\\n- current command evidence on the corrected CLI: exit 0, exact stdout, at least two passes, zero failures.\\nUnmet and indeterminate criteria must be preserved.\",\"reason\":\"Parent completion requires a semantic assessment of current evidence by a distinct actor. It can only run once the authored assets, the correction and fresh evidence on the current subject exist.\",\"supportRefs\":[\"obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5\"],\"evidenceRefs\":[\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\",\"result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c\"],\"dependsOn\":[\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5\",\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5\",\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5\",\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5\"]}],\"gaps\":[],\"nextGraphFunctionRef\":\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5\",\"nextReason\":\"The baseline result 6514754a shows the supplied CLI fails: stdout was `Hello world!\\\\n` instead of `Hello, world!\\\\n`, and command 1 exited nonzero with both tests failing. This is the evidence the contract requires before a correction. Construction is a different registered choice from the testing that produced the failure. Running it now creates the explicit same-lineage correction that the revision obligation needs and establishes the steel thread. Construction is not assessing a Result, so `subjectEvidenceRef` is null.\",\"nextEvidenceRefs\":[\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\",\"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/8e48f0d7a3888cff05d203ffb536f1f99581cba67f3521180a072edc2bf8dc68\",\"result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c\"],\"subjectEvidenceRef\":null,\"revisionReason\":\"The prior judgment (bc7d9d04) chose baseline testing next, and it has now run (6514754a) and found a material failure. It is kept as historical evidence. I've removed construction's dependency on design: the failure pinpoints the defect and the original source stage directly defines the required output, so the design is not needed for this bounded fix. Testing is now a re-measurement of the corrected subject, so it depends on construction. Specification, design and UAT are unchanged from the prior judgment.\",\"revisionEvidenceRefs\":[\"result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c\",\"result://abiogenesis/bc7d9d04c2fe7c8104f819f3dd260128ecc3faca42dc57446927b3ca7df16e7c\",\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\"],\"requirementProposals\":[]}","structured_output":{"interpretation":"We now have the baseline measurement for the unchanged supplied CLI (29 bytes, sha256:647697a5…) in result 6514754a. Command 0 (`node generated/hello-world.mjs`) exited 0 but printed `Hello world!\\n` without the comma. Command 1 (the component and UAT test run) exited 1: 2 tests, 0 passes, 2 failures, both on the same stdout mismatch against `Hello, world!\\n`. This is the material baseline failure the contract asks for. It also matches the adverse nonzero expectation declared for command 1 under the revision obligation. It remains historical evidence about those exact earlier bytes. The two supplied tests work as verifiers: both actually spawned the CLI and caught the defect, so they can be reused. The four authored assets are still absent, and all seven obligations remain open. The baseline justifies a different registered choice: a bounded construction correction limited to `generated/hello-world.mjs`. The failure pinpoints the exact defect, and the source requirement comes directly from the original task, so the correction does not need the design documents first. This is the steel-thread path: correct the runnable path early, then re-measure the corrected current subject. Specification and design can be written against the corrected worksite. They are not affected by the CLI bytes, except that the implementation design should describe the actual corrected source surface. Final completion still needs fresh command evidence on the corrected bytes and an independent UAT covering all mandatory outcomes.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5","contribution":"Make a bounded correction to `generated/hello-world.mjs` only, justified by the admitted baseline failure in result 6514754a. The CLI printed `Hello world!\\n` and both tests failed on the missing comma. After the change, the script must run under plain `node` with no package installation, exit 0, and write exactly `Hello, world!` followed by one newline to stdout, with nothing else on stdout. Do not modify tests, source, oracle, contract or any other path.","reason":"The contract requires the actual baseline failure to justify a different registered choice and a real correction in the same lineage. That failure is now observed: command 1 exited nonzero with 0 passes and 2 failures, and command 0 printed the wrong stdout. The defect is exactly located, and the original source stage defines the required behavior directly. The implementation design is therefore not a prerequisite for this minimal fix, so I've dropped the earlier dependency on design. Correcting now creates the direct causal link from failure to correction and establishes the steel thread early.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5","obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/8e48f0d7a3888cff05d203ffb536f1f99581cba67f3521180a072edc2bf8dc68","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c","result://abiogenesis/bc7d9d04c2fe7c8104f819f3dd260128ecc3faca42dc57446927b3ca7df16e7c"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5","contribution":"Re-measure the corrected current subject with the s